<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY FIVE RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY FIVE RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>MOHALI, India</dateline>
<text>
<p>India beat Australia by five runs in the concluding preliminary league match of the Titan Cup triangular limited-over series on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 289-6 in 50 overs (M.Azharuddin 94, S.Tendulkar 62, R.Dravid 56), Australia 284 in 49.1 overs.</p>
